    "description": "Initialization and setup notebook for the Eutrophication Workbench (EWB) workflow in JupyterLab. It configures a user's local workspace by copying template query notebooks and configuration files from the shared Public/ directory into /home/jovyan/workspace/<myfolder>. Upon execution, it prompts the user for run parameters—including user initials, temporal bounds (YYYYMM), and depth ranges (meters)—and automatically builds the required local folder structure (1_DatalakeQuery/, 2_CWduplicates-tool/, 3_FileForge/). This notebook serves as the mandatory prerequisite step before running BEACON query workflows or duplicate processing tools.",
